Mark Blackman: Any one of these areas, like, the state changes,

110
00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.640
Mark Blackman: You could have, that within its own

111
00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:53.709
Mark Blackman: dub tree within the… the master state tree, and that could roll up to a root, so we could effectively,

112
00:17:54.000 --> 00:18:05.710
Mark Blackman: make changes to a particular part of the block, and roll that up, and quickly, A, see what has changed, and then, additionally, if you're just

